            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"What is the weather in Tokyo? Use get_weather, then answer in one short sentence. Then solve, reasoning it through first: a train leaves at 09:47 and travels 283 km at 74 km/h; when does it arrive, to the minute?\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01PhCaz4btNjQQNuPFVYXumH\",\"name\":\"get_weather\",\"input\":{\"city\":\"Tokyo\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01PhCaz4btNjQQNuPFVYXumH\",\"content\":\"Tokyo: clear\\n25°C, wind 10 km/h\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm converting 283/74 hours into hours and minutes, which gives about 3 h 49.46 min. Added to 09:47, that lands at 13:36, with roughly 28 seconds more if I want the seconds.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Tokyo is clear, 25°C, with 10 km/h wind.\\n\\nTravel time is 283 ÷ 74 ≈ 3.824 h. That is 3 h plus 0.824 × 60 ≈ 49.46 min, or about 3 h 49 min 28 s.\\n\\nAdding that to 09:47 gives 13:36 and about 28 seconds.\\n\\n**The train arrives at about 13:36.**\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Should I bring an umbrella? One word.\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a weather assistant. Answer briefly.\\n\\n<addendum>\\nReference for pi-restore-anthropic-sonnet-5-5-thinking: the weather desk's station catalog. Use it only when asked.\\n- Station 1: code WX001, elevation 0 m, reports hourly.\\n- Station 2: code WX002, elevation 37 m, reports